      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضٌ أَرْمَآءُ</span></b>  <i>Land in which there is not a root,</i>
or <i>stock, of a tree; as though it were</i> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَأْرُومَة</span></b>  [or
<i>extirpated</i>]: (O:) or <i>land in which neither root
nor branch is left;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَأْرُومَةٌ</span></b> . (M, K.)

